<title>AUSTRIA: Austria NatBank allots 5.68 bln ats in repos.</title>
<headline>Austria NatBank allots 5.68 bln ats in repos.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1996-10-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Austrian National Bank said on Friday it had allocated 5.68 billion schillings in one-week securities repurchase agreements at an unchanged three percent.</p>
<p>The central bank said six percent of bids were filled.</p>
<p>Last week, the bank allotted 10.91 billion schillings, or 12 percent of bids, in repos. -- Vienna Newsroom, 43-1-53112-258</p>
